{"id":"vod_bf_20440","vodId":"20440","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"灵能百分百第一季","name_cn":"灵能百分百第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-21/3ffb039b9119f909887f72b6e4ba6d98.jpg"},"summary":"眼睛只看到金钱的江湖骗子灵幻新隆衣冠楚楚，道貌岸然，巧舌如簧，他以灵能力者的身份替委托者解决各种诡异事件，其实半点灵力没有。每当遇见真正的恶灵而又无法解决时，灵幻便会叫来他的弟子——真正拥有超强令能力的中学生影山茂夫（绰号“龙套”）。龙套君无论在学校还是家中都毫无存在感，呆呆傻傻的他隐藏着常人甚至灵能力者都难以想象的可怕力量。每当他的灵能力值达到100%时，他的对手必将遭遇有生以来最可怕的回忆。在与灵幻老师修行的过程中，龙套君遇到了各式各样的敌人，灵魂深处的自我也渐渐苏醒……　　本片根据漫画家ONE的同名原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"科幻,动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:49:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"classicRank":102,"franchise":"灵能百分百","playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241209xCdhWKEoindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241209wzJoYaHuindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/lingnengbaifenbaidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241209xwtZDOt3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202412093mxByLViindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/lingnengb